        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "分离是否真的在发生 —— 引擎口径，所有连接器都有数据",
      "type": "row",
      "description": "这一段读的是**引擎自己**的指标（不是连接器），所以 vLLM+NIXL、vLLM+Mooncake（昇腾）、SGLang 都有数据。空了通常只意味着这段时间没有实例在跑。"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Decode Tokens From Transfer",
      "description": "decode 侧的 prompt token 里，有多少是**从 prefill 传过来**而不是自己重算的。\n\n**这是判断分离有没有生效的第一指标**，因为它来自引擎而非连接器 —— Mooncake 没有任何传输计数器时，它仍然有数据。\n\n100% = 每个 token 都复用了 prefill 的成果；接近 0% = 分离已经静默退化成聚合推理。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "无数据 · 这段时间没有实例在跑"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(increase(gpustack:pd_prompt_tokens_by_source_total{cluster_name=\"$cluster_name\", model_name=\"$model_name\", role=\"decode\", source=\"external_kv_transfer\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(gpustack:pd_prompt_tokens_by_source_total{cluster_name=\"$cluster_name\", model_name=\"$model_name\", role=\"decode\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
