      "description": "Requests dropped between the two hops: prefill computed their KV and nobody ever read it. Rising means work is being thrown away.\n\nAbsent (no data) rather than zero on connectors that export no such counter -- Mooncake exports none, and '0 expired' there would be a claim we cannot make.\n\n⚠️ 这一段读的是**连接器**导出的计数器，各家差别很大：\n· vLLM + NIXL：字节/时长/失败/租约 **全都有**\n· vLLM + Mooncake（昇腾）：**一个都没有** —— `mooncake/stats.py` 导出 0 个计数器。判断分离是否生效请看上面第一段的 token 口径\n· SGLang：**只有时长**（`kv_transfer_bootstrap_ms`），0.5.15 起没有字节计数器\n另外：`KV counted on` 选反的那一侧恒为 0（NIXL/Mooncake 选 decode，SGLang 选 prefill）。",
